&lt;h5 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;３　確定拠出制度&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;確定拠出制度への要拠出額は、前連結会計年度&lt;span&gt;27,508千円&lt;/span&gt;、当連結会計年度&lt;span&gt;28,655千円&lt;/span&gt;であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;　　&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRetirementBenefitsConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesTaxEffectAccountingConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6 class="smt_head4"&gt;(税効果会計関係)&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;１  繰延税金資産及び繰延税金負債の発生の主な原因別の内訳&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:13pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
